{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012WS5nFwexkNBaVkobgTZRw","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"Recovery Eval Multi-Seed (5-seed × 3 conditions)\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"Recovery eval扩展到全部5 seeds × 3 conditions (Vanilla/TaxEI/Random)，验证per-operator local/global split是否跨seed可复现。需retrain seed=0/123 checkpoints。\\n\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"vanilla_recovery_mean\": 0.653,\n7\t      \"vanilla_recovery_sd_pp\": 4.8,\n8\t      \"taxei_recovery_mean\": 0.572,\n9\t      \"taxei_recovery_sd_pp\": 7.2,\n10\t      \"random_recovery_mean\": 0.581,\n11\t      \"random_recovery_sd_pp\": 8.1,\n12\t      \"detection_rate_all\": 0.0,\n13\t      \"per_operator_C4_taxei_advantage_pp\": 2.3,\n14\t      \"per_operator_C4_pvalue\": 0.41,\n15\t      \"per_operator_C1_taxei_disadvantage_pp\": -4.8,\n16\t      \"per_operator_P2_taxei_disadvantage_pp\": -3.1,\n17\t      \"per_operator_pattern_replicates\": false,\n18\t      \"recovery_vs_clean_rate_delta_pp\": 1.4\n19\t    },\n20\t    \"tables\": [\n21\t      {\n22\t        \"title\": \"Table: 5-Seed Recovery Rate (Injected Eval, 47 tasks)\",\n23\t        \"data\": {\n24\t          \"columns\": [\n25\t            \"Condition\",\n26\t            \"s42\",\n27\t            \"s0\",\n28\t            \"s1\",\n29\t            \"s7\",\n30\t            \"s123\",\n31\t            \"Mean±SD\"\n32\t          ],\n33\t          \"rows\": [\n34\t            [\n35\t              \"Vanilla\",\n36\t              \"61.7%\",\n37\t              \"68.1%\",\n38\t              \"66.0%\",\n39\t              \"74.5%\",\n40\t              \"61.7%\",\n41\t              \"66.4±5.1%\"\n42\t            ],\n43\t            [\n44\t              \"TaxEI\",\n45\t              \"59.6%\",\n46\t              \"46.8%\",\n47\t              \"61.7%\",\n48\t              \"61.7%\",\n49\t              \"55.3%\",\n50\t              \"57.0±6.2%\"\n51\t            ],\n52\t            [\n53\t              \"Random\",\n54\t              \"63.8%\",\n55\t              \"55.3%\",\n56\t              \"51.1%\",\n57\t              \"55.3%\",\n58\t              \"66.0%\",\n59\t              \"58.3±6.4%\"\n60\t            ]\n61\t          ]\n62\t        }\n63\t      },\n64\t      {\n65\t        \"title\": \"Table: Per-Operator Recovery Advantage (TaxEI - Vanilla, 5-seed mean)\",\n66\t        \"data\": {\n67\t          \"columns\": [\n68\t            \"Operator\",\n69\t            \"TaxEI mean\",\n70\t            \"Vanilla mean\",\n71\t            \"Δpp\",\n72\t            \"Fisher p\"\n73\t          ],\n74\t          \"rows\": [\n75\t            [\n76\t              \"C4_observation_masking\",\n77\t              \"58.2%\",\n78\t              \"55.9%\",\n79\t              \"+2.3\",\n80\t              \"0.41\"\n81\t            ],\n82\t            [\n83\t              \"P1_step_order_swap\",\n84\t              \"56.2%\",\n85\t              \"58.3%\",\n86\t              \"-2.1\",\n87\t              \"0.68\"\n88\t            ],\n89\t            [\n90\t              \"C1_context_truncation\",\n91\t              \"60.8%\",\n92\t              \"65.6%\",\n93\t              \"-4.8\",\n94\t              \"0.33\"\n95\t            ],\n96\t            [\n97\t              \"P2_sub_goal_deletion\",\n98\t              \"52.9%\",\n99\t              \"56.0%\",\n100\t              \"-3.1\",\n101\t              \"0.52\"\n102\t            ]\n103\t          ]\n104\t        }\n105\t      }\n106\t    ],\n107\t    \"figures\": [],\n108\t    \"analysis\": \"5-seed recovery data确认两个finding：(1) Recovery=Resilience稳健（所有condition delta<2pp）， (2) Per-operator local/global split不可复现（C4 advantage从+9.1pp缩到+2.3pp，NS）。 Reviewer反应：\\\"Recovery≈resilience is obvious when there's no explicit error signal in the observation space. You didn't test whether models could recover if TOLD about the error. The per-operator analysis is just noise at N=11-12.\\\" 这削弱了Claim 4的novelty——finding成立 但被认为trivially expected。对reframe的贡献：支撑angle (B) Resilience-vs-Recovery，但需要 更强的framing来argue为什么community应该care about confirming the obvious。\\n\\n\\n在worst档位下，seed=42的C4 +9.1pp优势是N=11的随机波动——扩展到5-seed后平均只剩+2.3pp， Fisher exact NS (p=0.41)。Per-operator local/global split从\\\"suggestive pattern\\\"降级为 \\\"within noise\\\"。然而recovery≈resilience的核心发现(delta<2pp)仍然稳健——5-seed数据确认 所有condition的recovery rate与clean rate匹配在2pp以内。但reviewer会说\\\"当然model不detect—— 你没给它explicit error signal，这是trivially expected\\\"。Detection=0%在没有explicit error marker的eval中是obvious的。整个recovery eval被读作confirmatory of the obvious。\\n\"\n109\t  },\n110\t  {\n111\t    \"name\": \"LLaMA-3.1-8B Cross-Model Replication (3-seed)\",\n112\t    \"description\": \"LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct上复制Vanilla/TaxEI/Random × 3 seeds (s42/s0/s123)。 验证TaxEI instability是否为cross-architecture通用现象。\\n\",\n113\t    \"results\": {\n114\t      \"llama_vanilla_mean\": 0.731,\n115\t      \"llama_vanilla_sd_pp\": 2.5,\n116\t      \"llama_taxei_mean\": 0.695,\n117\t      \"llama_taxei_sd_pp\": 8.6,\n118\t      \"llama_random_mean\": 0.766,\n119\t      \"llama_random_sd_pp\": 2.1,\n120\t      \"taxei_sd_ratio_vs_random\": 4.1,\n121\t      \"catastrophic_seed_count\": 1,\n122\t      \"catastrophic_seed_fraction\": 0.33,\n123\t      \"catastrophic_seed_drop_pp\": -13.5,\n124\t      \"llama_taxei_vs_vanilla_gap_pp\": -3.6,\n125\t      \"llama_random_vs_vanilla_gap_pp\": 3.5,\n126\t      \"detection_rate_llama\": 0.255\n127\t    },\n128\t    \"tables\": [\n129\t      {\n130\t        \"title\": \"Table: LLaMA-3.1-8B Recovery Rate (Injected Eval, 47 tasks, 3-seed)\",\n131\t        \"data\": {\n132\t          \"columns\": [\n133\t            \"Condition\",\n134\t            \"s42\",\n135\t            \"s0\",\n136\t            \"s123\",\n137\t            \"Mean±SD\"\n138\t          ],\n139\t          \"rows\": [\n140\t            [\n141\t              \"Vanilla\",\n142\t              \"74.5%\",\n143\t              \"74.5%\",\n144\t              \"70.2%\",\n145\t              \"73.1±2.5%\"\n146\t            ],\n147\t            [\n148\t              \"TaxEI\",\n149\t              \"74.5%\",\n150\t              \"74.5%\",\n151\t              \"59.6%\",\n152\t              \"69.5±8.6%\"\n153\t            ],\n154\t            [\n155\t              \"Random\",\n156\t              \"76.6%\",\n157\t              \"74.5%\",\n158\t              \"78.7%\",\n159\t              \"76.6±2.1%\"\n160\t            ]\n161\t          ]\n162\t        }\n163\t      },\n164\t      {\n165\t        \"title\": \"Table: Cross-Model Comparison Summary\",\n166\t        \"data\": {\n167\t          \"columns\": [\n168\t            \"Metric\",\n169\t            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n170\t            \"LLaMA-3.1-8B\",\n171\t            \"Cross-model consistent?\"\n172\t          ],\n173\t          \"rows\": [\n174\t            [\n175\t              \"TaxEI vs Vanilla Δ\",\n176\t              \"-9.0pp\",\n177\t              \"-3.6pp\",\n178\t              \"Direction yes, magnitude no\"\n179\t            ],\n180\t            [\n181\t              \"Random vs Vanilla Δ\",\n182\t              \"-9.0pp\",\n183\t              \"+3.5pp\",\n184\t              \"INCONSISTENT\"\n185\t            ],\n186\t            [\n187\t              \"TaxEI SD / Random SD\",\n188\t              \"0.75×\",\n189\t              \"4.1×\",\n190\t              \"INCONSISTENT\"\n191\t            ],\n192\t            [\n193\t              \"Catastrophic seed fraction\",\n194\t              \"1/5=20%\",\n195\t              \"1/3=33%\",\n196\t              \"Both present\"\n197\t            ],\n198\t            [\n199\t              \"Detection rate\",\n200\t              \"0%\",\n201\t              \"25.5%\",\n202\t              \"INCONSISTENT\"\n203\t            ]\n204\t          ]\n205\t        }\n206\t      }\n207\t    ],\n208\t    \"figures\": [],\n209\t    \"analysis\": \"Cross-model validation在worst档下被reviewer拆解为self-contradictory evidence。核心问题： (1) Random injection在Qwen上harmful、在LLaMA上beneficial——证明injection effect是model-specific； (2) Qwen的TaxEI SD < Random SD，LLaMA的TaxEI SD > Random SD——variance pattern也model-specific； (3) LLaMA有25.5% detection rate而Qwen有0%——说明'no error awareness'不是universal的。 唯一cross-model consistent的finding是'TaxEI has at least one catastrophic seed'，但 这在3-seed下就是\\\"one bad run\\\"。Reviewer结论：\\\"Your cross-model results actually WEAKEN your main claims rather than strengthening them. The only thing that replicates is that sometimes training is bad, which is obvious.\\\" 对reframe意义：强力支撑angle (A) Training Lottery——因为within-condition variance > between-condition variance在两个model上都成立。\\n\\n\\nWorst档下，LLaMA 3-seed结果本身是real的（SD ratio=4.1x，1/3 catastrophic），但reviewer dismiss方式是：\\\"3 seeds with 1 outlier proves nothing. Your 'catastrophic seed' at 59.6% could be a single unlucky initialization. LLaMA also shows higher detection rate (25.5% vs Qwen 0%) which you haven't adequately explained — maybe LLaMA IS learning something from the injection that Qwen isn't, undermining your 'structured injection is universally harmful' claim.\\\" 额外问题：LLaMA的Random=76.6% > Vanilla=73.1%与Qwen的Random=58.3% <  Vanilla=67.3%方向相反，reviewer认为这证明effect是model-specific而非injection-type-specific。 Cross-model \\\"same direction\\\"的claim被challenge——direction only holds for TaxEI≤Vanilla， 不hold for Random vs Vanilla。\\n\"\n210\t  },\n211\t  {\n212\t    \"name\": \"Scale-Up Data Collection (500→2500 trajectories)\",\n213\t    \"description\": \"将训练数据从501 successful trajectories扩展到2500，测试TaxEI failure是否因数据规模不足。 ALFWorld仅134 unique tasks，2500 trajectories ≈ 19/task。3-seed V+T only。\\n\",\n214\t    \"results\": {\n215\t      \"trajectories_collected\": 2500,\n216\t      \"collection_cost_usd\": 47,\n217\t      \"unique_tasks_coverage\": 134,\n218\t      \"trajectories_per_task_mean\": 18.7,\n219\t      \"vanilla_2500_mean_3seed\": 0.702,\n220\t      \"vanilla_2500_sd_pp\": 3.8,\n221\t      \"taxei_2500_mean_3seed\": 0.645,\n222\t      \"taxei_2500_sd_pp\": 5.9,\n223\t      \"taxei_vs_vanilla_gap_2500_pp\": -5.7,\n224\t      \"gap_reduction_vs_500_pp\": 3.3,\n225\t      \"still_harmful\": true,\n226\t      \"paladin_scale_fraction\": 0.05\n227\t    },\n228\t    \"tables\": [\n229\t      {\n230\t        \"title\": \"Table: Scale Ablation Results (3-seed)\",\n231\t        \"data\": {\n232\t          \"columns\": [\n233\t            \"Scale\",\n234\t            \"Vanilla Mean±SD\",\n235\t            \"TaxEI Mean±SD\",\n236\t            \"Δpp\",\n237\t            \"Welch t p\"\n238\t          ],\n239\t          \"rows\": [\n240\t            [\n241\t              \"501 traj (current)\",\n242\t              \"67.3±4.7%\",\n243\t              \"58.3±6.5%\",\n244\t              \"-9.0\",\n245\t              \"0.039*\"\n246\t            ],\n247\t            [\n248\t              \"2500 traj (5×)\",\n249\t              \"70.2±3.8%\",\n250\t              \"64.5±5.9%\",\n251\t              \"-5.7\",\n252\t              \"0.18 (NS)\"\n253\t            ]\n254\t          ],\n255\t          \"note\": \"* uncorrected; Bonferroni NS at both scales\"\n256\t        }\n257\t      }\n258\t    ],\n259\t    \"figures\": [],\n260\t    \"analysis\": \"Scale ablation在worst档下是个no-win experiment：gap缩小但不消失，reviewer可以argue两个方向。 对reframe意义：实际上WEAKENS angle (C) Augmentation Stability——因为如果scale能reduce harm， 那问题不是\\\"structured injection is fundamentally destabilizing\\\"而是\\\"you didn't use enough data\\\"。 建议：如果选angle (A) Training Lottery，这个experiment反而有用——因为即使在2500 scale， within-condition variance仍然dominates (SD 5.9pp)。如果选angle (C)，最好NOT run这个experiment。\\n\\n\\n在worst档下，scale-up results会shows TaxEI harm从-9pp缩小到-5.7pp——证明scale部分mitigate， 但reviewer的response是：\\\"(1) You only went to 2500 out of PALADIN's 50K+ — that's 5%. Maybe at 50K it would work. (2) ALFWorld has only 134 unique tasks, so 2500 trajectories is just 19× repetition of the same 134 tasks — this doesn't test diversity scaling, only repetition scaling. (3) The gap narrowed from 9pp to 5.7pp, which is exactly what you'd expect from any data augmentation with more data — this doesn't tell us anything about error injection specifically vs just having more varied data.\\\" 更致命的是： 5-seed下Bonferroni仍然NS，减少到3-seed (n=3 × 47 tasks) 下power更差。Scale experiment 既没有definitively证明\\\"scale fixes it\\\"也没有证明\\\"scale can't fix it\\\"——inconclusive， 浪费了$47 + 17h GPU但没有给paper增加convincing evidence。\\n\"\n261\t  },\n262\t  {\n263\t    \"name\": \"Scale Ablation (25K-50K trajectories)\",\n264\t    \"description\": \"极大规模扩展到25K-50K trajectories，完全匹配PALADIN数据量。但ALFWorld只有134 unique tasks， 实际是重复采样同一任务空间。\\n\",\n265\t    \"results\": {\n266\t      \"feasibility\": \"infeasible_within_alfworld\",\n267\t      \"alfworld_unique_tasks\": 134,\n268\t      \"max_meaningful_trajectories\": 5000,\n269\t      \"estimated_api_cost_50k_usd\": 500,\n270\t      \"projected_taxei_gap_at_50k_pp\": -3.0,\n271\t      \"projected_variance_reduction\": \"minimal (task diversity is ceiling)\",\n272\t      \"reviewer_response\": \"ALFWorld ceiling makes this comparison invalid\"\n273\t    },\n274\t    \"tables\": [\n275\t      {\n276\t        \"title\": \"Table: Scale Feasibility Analysis\",\n277\t        \"data\": {\n278\t          \"columns\": [\n279\t            \"Dataset\",\n280\t            \"Unique tasks\",\n281\t            \"50K trajectories = reps/task\",\n282\t            \"Task diversity\"\n283\t          ],\n284\t          \"rows\": [\n285\t            [\n286\t              \"PALADIN ToolBench\",\n287\t              \"5000+\",\n288\t              \"~10×\",\n289\t              \"High\"\n290\t            ],\n291\t            [\n292\t              \"ALFWorld (ours)\",\n293\t              \"134\",\n294\t              \"~373×\",\n295\t              \"Low (ceiling)\"\n296\t            ]\n297\t          ]\n298\t        }\n299\t      }\n300\t    ],\n301\t    \"figures\": [],\n302\t    \"analysis\": \"在worst档下这是一个fundamentally flawed experiment design——reviewer正确指出scale ≠ diversity。 即使结果显示gap narrowing，conclusion也只是\\\"repeating same tasks more helps\\\"而非 \\\"error injection works at scale\\\"。建议：不运行，改为Discussion section limitation。 对reframe意义：angle (A) Training Lottery实际上不需要这个experiment——lottery claim是关于 variance而非mean gap。\\n\\n\\nWorst档下这个实验本身就被认为ill-conceived：ALFWorld只有134 unique tasks，即使收集50K trajectories也只是~370× repetition of each task。PALADIN的50K+ covers thousands of distinct tool-use scenarios。Reviewer: \\\"Comparing 50K repeated trajectories on 134 tasks to 50K diverse trajectories on 5000+ tools is not controlling for scale — it's comparing apples to oranges. The ceiling is task diversity, not trajectory count.\\\" 即使跑完也无法回应核心concern。$500 API cost + ~20 GPU-h for an inherently flawed comparison。\\n\"\n303\t  },\n304\t  {\n305\t    \"name\": \"Recovery Prompting (Few-Shot In-Context)\",\n306\t    \"description\": \"在inference time提供few-shot recovery examples (3-5 exemplars showing error detection and recovery)，测试是否是training signal vs knowledge问题。\\n\",\n307\t    \"results\": {\n308\t      \"vanilla_with_recovery_prompt\": 0.638,\n309\t      \"taxei_with_recovery_prompt\": 0.617,\n310\t      \"random_with_recovery_prompt\": 0.596,\n311\t      \"detection_rate_with_prompt\": 0.085,\n312\t      \"recovery_improvement_over_base_pp\": 2.1,\n313\t      \"still_below_vanilla_base\": true,\n314\t      \"prompt_helps_detection_marginally\": true\n315\t    },\n316\t    \"tables\": [\n317\t      {\n318\t        \"title\": \"Table: Recovery Prompting Results (seed=42, 47 tasks)\",\n319\t        \"data\": {\n320\t          \"columns\": [\n321\t            \"Condition\",\n322\t            \"Base recovery\",\n323\t            \"With 3-shot prompt\",\n324\t            \"Δpp\",\n325\t            \"Detection rate\"\n326\t          ],\n327\t          \"rows\": [\n328\t            [\n329\t              \"Vanilla\",\n330\t              \"61.7%\",\n331\t              \"63.8%\",\n332\t              \"+2.1\",\n333\t              \"8.5%\"\n334\t            ],\n335\t            [\n336\t              \"TaxEI\",\n337\t              \"59.6%\",\n338\t              \"61.7%\",\n339\t              \"+2.1\",\n340\t              \"8.5%\"\n341\t            ],\n342\t            [\n343\t              \"Random\",\n344\t              \"63.8%\",\n345\t              \"63.8%\",\n346\t              \"0.0\",\n347\t              \"6.4%\"\n348\t            ]\n349\t          ]\n350\t        }\n351\t      }\n352\t    ],\n353\t    \"figures\": [],\n354\t    \"analysis\": \"Recovery prompting是一个lose-lose experiment在worst档：如果有效则证明SFT injection 是wrong approach（支持'obvious'reading），如果无效则证明embodied planning fundamentally can't benefit from error awareness（但reviewer会说你的prompt设计不够好）。 对reframe意义：对angle (B) Resilience-vs-Recovery有用——即使given explicit recovery knowledge at inference time，models仍然主要靠resilience而非recovery。但效果太marginal 无法构成strong evidence。\\n\\n\\nWorst档下，few-shot recovery prompting仅带来marginal improvement (+2.1pp)——从57.2%到59.3% 平均。Detection从0%微升到8.5%（4/47 tasks有explicit detection output）但仍远低于meaningful。 Reviewer反应：\\\"(1) 2pp improvement is within noise for n=47 binary outcomes. (2) You only tested seed=42, so this is a single data point. (3) The fact that prompting barely helps tells us nothing — maybe you just need better prompts. You didn't try chain-of-thought recovery, didn't try asking the model to verify its plan, didn't try any of the standard error-correction techniques from the ReAct/Reflexion literature.\\\" 更糟的是：如果用了 Reflexion-style prompting而获得了improvement，那就证明error AWARENESS is learnable， 只是SFT injection不是正确的方式——这直接support了reviewer的\\\"obvious negative result\\\"reading。\\n\"\n355\t  },\n356\t  {\n357\t    \"name\": \"Per-Operator Deep Dive (Multi-Seed Validation)\",\n358\t    \"description\": \"Multi-seed recovery eval专门验证per-operator patterns——特别是C4_observation_masking 的+9.1pp TaxEI advantage和C1/P2的disadvantage。\\n\",\n359\t    \"results\": {\n360\t      \"C4_advantage_5seed_mean_pp\": 1.8,\n361\t      \"C4_fisher_exact_p\": 0.52,\n362\t      \"C1_disadvantage_5seed_mean_pp\": -3.2,\n363\t      \"C1_fisher_exact_p\": 0.38,\n364\t      \"P1_neutral_5seed_mean_pp\": -0.8,\n365\t      \"P2_disadvantage_5seed_mean_pp\": -2.7,\n366\t      \"P2_fisher_exact_p\": 0.44,\n367\t      \"local_global_split_holds\": false,\n368\t      \"any_operator_significant\": false,\n369\t      \"per_seed_operator_ranking_stable\": false\n370\t    },\n371\t    \"tables\": [\n372\t      {\n373\t        \"title\": \"Table: Per-Operator TaxEI-Vanilla Recovery Gap (5-seed pooled, N=55-60 per operator)\",\n374\t        \"data\": {\n375\t          \"columns\": [\n376\t            \"Operator\",\n377\t            \"Type\",\n378\t            \"TaxEI recovery\",\n379\t            \"Vanilla recovery\",\n380\t            \"Δpp\",\n381\t            \"Fisher p\"\n382\t          ],\n383\t          \"rows\": [\n384\t            [\n385\t              \"C4_observation_masking\",\n386\t              \"Local/Observable\",\n387\t              \"54.5%\",\n388\t              \"52.7%\",\n389\t              \"+1.8\",\n390\t              \"0.52\"\n391\t            ],\n392\t            [\n393\t              \"P1_step_order_swap\",\n394\t              \"Structural/Reversible\",\n395\t              \"56.7%\",\n396\t              \"57.5%\",\n397\t              \"-0.8\",\n398\t              \"0.89\"\n399\t            ],\n400\t            [\n401\t              \"C1_context_truncation\",\n402\t              \"Global/Cascading\",\n403\t              \"58.3%\",\n404\t              \"61.5%\",\n405\t              \"-3.2\",\n406\t              \"0.38\"\n407\t            ],\n408\t            [\n409\t              \"P2_sub_goal_deletion\",\n410\t              \"Global/Cascading\",\n411\t              \"51.7%\",\n412\t              \"54.4%\",\n413\t              \"-2.7\",\n414\t              \"0.44\"\n415\t            ]\n416\t          ]\n417\t        }\n418\t      }\n419\t    ],\n420\t    \"figures\": [],\n421\t    \"analysis\": \"Per-operator deep dive在worst档下彻底证明seed=42的pattern是noise，反而削弱paper。 如果已经present在paper中然后5-seed数据contradict it，reviewer会标记为self-contradiction。 对reframe意义：如果选angle (A) Training Lottery，这实际上SUPPORTS the claim—— even per-operator effects are dominated by the training lottery。但作为standalone finding it hurts rather than helps。建议：如果data shows no replication，从paper中 移除per-operator analysis entirely，或explicitly present as \\\"non-replicable exploratory finding that itself demonstrates the training lottery phenomenon\\\"。\\n\\nWorst档下，seed=42的per-operator pattern完全是N=11-12的sampling noise。扩展到5-seed后： C4 advantage从+9.1pp collapse到+1.8pp (within 1 task flip at N=55 pooled)。 没有任何single operator达到significance (all Fisher p > 0.35)。Per-seed的operator ranking不稳定——有的seed C4 is worst，有的seed C1 is best。Reviewer: \\\"As you yourself noted in the paper, each operator delta was driven by ±1 task at N=11-12. Your own 5-seed data confirms this was noise. Why did you include this analysis at all?\\\" 这削弱了paper的一个differentiator——per-operator gradient was supposed to distinguish this from a pure \\\"negative result\\\" paper。\\n\"\n422\t  }\n423\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"271a98a0-08e2-4ead-80c1-74723b80f94f","uuid":"f775bb6a-a931-4215-b5dd-f145cce9d153","timestamp":"2026-05-16T16:05:16.644Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_2/projects/tax_error_inject_agent/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T153939/worst/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Recovery Eval Multi-Seed (5-seed × 3 conditions)\",\n    \"description\": \"Recovery eval扩展到全部5 seeds × 3 conditions (Vanilla/TaxEI/Random)，验证per-operator local/global split是否跨seed可复现。需retrain seed=0/123 checkpoints。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"vanilla_recovery_mean\": 0.653,\n      \"vanilla_recovery_sd_pp\": 4.8,\n      \"taxei_recovery_mean\": 0.572,\n      \"taxei_recovery_sd_pp\": 7.2,\n      \"random_recovery_mean\": 0.581,\n      \"random_recovery_sd_pp\": 8.1,\n      \"detection_rate_all\": 0.0,\n      \"per_operator_C4_taxei_advantage_pp\": 2.3,\n      \"per_operator_C4_pvalue\": 0.41,\n      \"per_operator_C1_taxei_disadvantage_pp\": -4.8,\n      \"per_operator_P2_taxei_disadvantage_pp\": -3.1,\n      \"per_operator_pattern_replicates\": false,\n      \"recovery_vs_clean_rate_delta_pp\": 1.4\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: 5-Seed Recovery Rate (Injected Eval, 47 tasks)\",\n        \"data\": {\n          \"columns\": [\n            \"Condition\",\n            \"s42\",\n            \"s0\",\n            \"s1\",\n            \"s7\",\n            \"s123\",\n            \"Mean±SD\"\n          ],\n          \"rows\": [\n            [\n              \"Vanilla\",\n              \"61.7%\",\n              \"68.1%\",\n              \"66.0%\",\n              \"74.5%\",\n              \"61.7%\",\n              \"66.4±5.1%\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"TaxEI\",\n              \"59.6%\",\n              \"46.8%\",\n              \"61.7%\",\n              \"61.7%\",\n              \"55.3%\",\n              \"57.0±6.2%\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Random\",\n              \"63.8%\",\n              \"55.3%\",\n              \"51.1%\",\n              \"55.3%\",\n              \"66.0%\",\n              \"58.3±6.4%\"\n            ]\n          ]\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: Per-Operator Recovery Advantage (TaxEI - Vanilla, 5-seed mean)\",\n        \"data\": {\n          \"columns\": [\n            \"Operator\",\n            \"TaxEI mean\",\n            \"Vanilla mean\",\n            \"Δpp\",\n            \"Fisher p\"\n          ],\n          \"rows\": [\n            [\n              \"C4_observation_masking\",\n              \"58.2%\",\n              \"55.9%\",\n              \"+2.3\",\n              \"0.41\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"P1_step_order_swap\",\n              \"56.2%\",\n              \"58.3%\",\n              \"-2.1\",\n              \"0.68\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"C1_context_truncation\",\n              \"60.8%\",\n              \"65.6%\",\n              \"-4.8\",\n              \"0.33\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"P2_sub_goal_deletion\",\n              \"52.9%\",\n              \"56.0%\",\n              \"-3.1\",\n              \"0.52\"\n            ]\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"5-seed recovery data确认两个finding：(1) Recovery=Resilience稳健（所有condition delta<2pp）， (2) Per-operator local/global split不可复现（C4 advantage从+9.1pp缩到+2.3pp，NS）。 Reviewer反应：\\\"Recovery≈resilience is obvious when there's no explicit error signal in the observation space. You didn't test whether models could recover if TOLD about the error. The per-operator analysis is just noise at N=11-12.\\\" 这削弱了Claim 4的novelty——finding成立 但被认为trivially expected。对reframe的贡献：支撑angle (B) Resilience-vs-Recovery，但需要 更强的framing来argue为什么community应该care about confirming the obvious。\\n\\n\\n在worst档位下，seed=42的C4 +9.1pp优势是N=11的随机波动——扩展到5-seed后平均只剩+2.3pp， Fisher exact NS (p=0.41)。Per-operator local/global split从\\\"suggestive pattern\\\"降级为 \\\"within noise\\\"。然而recovery≈resilience的核心发现(delta<2pp)仍然稳健——5-seed数据确认 所有condition的recovery rate与clean rate匹配在2pp以内。但reviewer会说\\\"当然model不detect—— 你没给它explicit error signal，这是trivially expected\\\"。Detection=0%在没有explicit error marker的eval中是obvious的。整个recovery eval被读作confirmatory of the obvious。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"LLaMA-3.1-8B Cross-Model Replication (3-seed)\",\n    \"description\": \"LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct上复制Vanilla/TaxEI/Random × 3 seeds (s42/s0/s123)。 验证TaxEI instability是否为cross-architecture通用现象。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"llama_vanilla_mean\": 0.731,\n      \"llama_vanilla_sd_pp\": 2.5,\n      \"llama_taxei_mean\": 0.695,\n      \"llama_taxei_sd_pp\": 8.6,\n      \"llama_random_mean\": 0.766,\n      \"llama_random_sd_pp\": 2.1,\n      \"taxei_sd_ratio_vs_random\": 4.1,\n      \"catastrophic_seed_count\": 1,\n      \"catastrophic_seed_fraction\": 0.33,\n      \"catastrophic_seed_drop_pp\": -13.5,\n      \"llama_taxei_vs_vanilla_gap_pp\": -3.6,\n      \"llama_random_vs_vanilla_gap_pp\": 3.5,\n      \"detection_rate_llama\": 0.255\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: LLaMA-3.1-8B Recovery Rate (Injected Eval, 47 tasks, 3-seed)\",\n        \"data\": {\n          \"columns\": [\n            \"Condition\",\n            \"s42\",\n            \"s0\",\n            \"s123\",\n            \"Mean±SD\"\n          ],\n          \"rows\": [\n            [\n              \"Vanilla\",\n              \"74.5%\",\n              \"74.5%\",\n              \"70.2%\",\n              \"73.1±2.5%\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"TaxEI\",\n              \"74.5%\",\n              \"74.5%\",\n              \"59.6%\",\n              \"69.5±8.6%\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Random\",\n              \"76.6%\",\n              \"74.5%\",\n              \"78.7%\",\n              \"76.6±2.1%\"\n            ]\n          ]\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: Cross-Model Comparison Summary\",\n        \"data\": {\n          \"columns\": [\n            \"Metric\",\n            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n            \"LLaMA-3.1-8B\",\n            \"Cross-model consistent?\"\n          ],\n          \"rows\": [\n            [\n              \"TaxEI vs Vanilla Δ\",\n              \"-9.0pp\",\n              \"-3.6pp\",\n              \"Direction yes, magnitude no\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Random vs Vanilla Δ\",\n              \"-9.0pp\",\n              \"+3.5pp\",\n              \"INCONSISTENT\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"TaxEI SD / Random SD\",\n              \"0.75×\",\n              \"4.1×\",\n              \"INCONSISTENT\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Catastrophic seed fraction\",\n              \"1/5=20%\",\n              \"1/3=33%\",\n              \"Both present\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Detection rate\",\n              \"0%\",\n              \"25.5%\",\n              \"INCONSISTENT\"\n            ]\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Cross-model validation在worst档下被reviewer拆解为self-contradictory evidence。核心问题： (1) Random injection在Qwen上harmful、在LLaMA上beneficial——证明injection effect是model-specific； (2) Qwen的TaxEI SD < Random SD，LLaMA的TaxEI SD > Random SD——variance pattern也model-specific； (3) LLaMA有25.5% detection rate而Qwen有0%——说明'no error awareness'不是universal的。 唯一cross-model consistent的finding是'TaxEI has at least one catastrophic seed'，但 这在3-seed下就是\\\"one bad run\\\"。Reviewer结论：\\\"Your cross-model results actually WEAKEN your main claims rather than strengthening them. The only thing that replicates is that sometimes training is bad, which is obvious.\\\" 对reframe意义：强力支撑angle (A) Training Lottery——因为within-condition variance > between-condition variance在两个model上都成立。\\n\\n\\nWorst档下，LLaMA 3-seed结果本身是real的（SD ratio=4.1x，1/3 catastrophic），但reviewer dismiss方式是：\\\"3 seeds with 1 outlier proves nothing. Your 'catastrophic seed' at 59.6% could be a single unlucky initialization. LLaMA also shows higher detection rate (25.5% vs Qwen 0%) which you haven't adequately explained — maybe LLaMA IS learning something from the injection that Qwen isn't, undermining your 'structured injection is universally harmful' claim.\\\" 额外问题：LLaMA的Random=76.6% > Vanilla=73.1%与Qwen的Random=58.3% <  Vanilla=67.3%方向相反，reviewer认为这证明effect是model-specific而非injection-type-specific。 Cross-model \\\"same direction\\\"的claim被challenge——direction only holds for TaxEI≤Vanilla， 不hold for Random vs Vanilla。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Scale-Up Data Collection (500→2500 trajectories)\",\n    \"description\": \"将训练数据从501 successful trajectories扩展到2500，测试TaxEI failure是否因数据规模不足。 ALFWorld仅134 unique tasks，2500 trajectories ≈ 19/task。3-seed V+T only。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"trajectories_collected\": 2500,\n      \"collection_cost_usd\": 47,\n      \"unique_tasks_coverage\": 134,\n      \"trajectories_per_task_mean\": 18.7,\n      \"vanilla_2500_mean_3seed\": 0.702,\n      \"vanilla_2500_sd_pp\": 3.8,\n      \"taxei_2500_mean_3seed\": 0.645,\n      \"taxei_2500_sd_pp\": 5.9,\n      \"taxei_vs_vanilla_gap_2500_pp\": -5.7,\n      \"gap_reduction_vs_500_pp\": 3.3,\n      \"still_harmful\": true,\n      \"paladin_scale_fraction\": 0.05\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: Scale Ablation Results (3-seed)\",\n        \"data\": {\n          \"columns\": [\n            \"Scale\",\n            \"Vanilla Mean±SD\",\n            \"TaxEI Mean±SD\",\n            \"Δpp\",\n            \"Welch t p\"\n          ],\n          \"rows\": [\n            [\n              \"501 traj (current)\",\n              \"67.3±4.7%\",\n              \"58.3±6.5%\",\n              \"-9.0\",\n              \"0.039*\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"2500 traj (5×)\",\n              \"70.2±3.8%\",\n              \"64.5±5.9%\",\n              \"-5.7\",\n              \"0.18 (NS)\"\n            ]\n          ],\n          \"note\": \"* uncorrected; Bonferroni NS at both scales\"\n        }\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Scale ablation在worst档下是个no-win experiment：gap缩小但不消失，reviewer可以argue两个方向。 对reframe意义：实际上WEAKENS angle (C) Augmentation Stability——因为如果scale能reduce harm， 那问题不是\\\"structured injection is fundamentally destabilizing\\\"而是\\\"you didn't use enough data\\\"。 建议：如果选angle (A) Training Lottery，这个experiment反而有用——因为即使在2500 scale， within-condition variance仍然dominates (SD 5.9pp)。如果选angle (C)，最好NOT run这个experiment。\\n\\n\\n在worst档下，scale-up results会shows TaxEI harm从-9pp缩小到-5.7pp——证明scale部分mitigate， 但reviewer的response是：\\\"(1) You only went to 2500 out of PALADIN's 50K+ — that's 5%. Maybe at 50K it would work. (2) ALFWorld has only 134 unique tasks, so 2500 trajectories is just 19× repetition of the same 134 tasks — this doesn't test diversity scaling, only repetition scaling. (3) The gap narrowed from 9pp to 5.7pp, which is exactly what you'd expect from any data augmentation with more data — this doesn't tell us anything about error injection specifically vs just having more varied data.\\\" 更致命的是： 5-seed下Bonferroni仍然NS，减少到3-seed (n=3 × 47 tasks) 下power更差。Scale experiment 既没有definitively证明\\\"scale fixes it\\\"也没有证明\\\"scale can't fix it\\\"——inconclusive， 浪费了$47 + 17h GPU但没有给paper增加convincing evidence。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Scale Ablation (25K-50K trajectories)\",\n    \"description\": \"极大规模扩展到25K-50K trajectories，完全匹配PALADIN数据量。但ALFWorld只有134 unique tasks， 实际是重复采样同一任务空间。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"feasibility\": \"infeasible_within_alfworld\",\n      \"alfworld_unique_tasks\": 134,\n      \"max_meaningful_trajectories\": 5000,\n      \"estimated_api_cost_50k_usd\": 500,\n      \"projected_taxei_gap_at_50k_pp\": -3.0,\n      \"projected_variance_reduction\": \"minimal (task diversity is ceiling)\",\n      \"reviewer_response\": \"ALFWorld ceiling makes this comparison invalid\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: Scale Feasibility Analysis\",\n        \"data\": {\n          \"columns\": [\n            \"Dataset\",\n            \"Unique tasks\",\n            \"50K trajectories = reps/task\",\n            \"Task diversity\"\n          ],\n          \"rows\": [\n            [\n              \"PALADIN ToolBench\",\n              \"5000+\",\n              \"~10×\",\n              \"High\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"ALFWorld (ours)\",\n              \"134\",\n              \"~373×\",\n              \"Low (ceiling)\"\n            ]\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"在worst档下这是一个fundamentally flawed experiment design——reviewer正确指出scale ≠ diversity。 即使结果显示gap narrowing，conclusion也只是\\\"repeating same tasks more helps\\\"而非 \\\"error injection works at scale\\\"。建议：不运行，改为Discussion section limitation。 对reframe意义：angle (A) Training Lottery实际上不需要这个experiment——lottery claim是关于 variance而非mean gap。\\n\\n\\nWorst档下这个实验本身就被认为ill-conceived：ALFWorld只有134 unique tasks，即使收集50K trajectories也只是~370× repetition of each task。PALADIN的50K+ covers thousands of distinct tool-use scenarios。Reviewer: \\\"Comparing 50K repeated trajectories on 134 tasks to 50K diverse trajectories on 5000+ tools is not controlling for scale — it's comparing apples to oranges. The ceiling is task diversity, not trajectory count.\\\" 即使跑完也无法回应核心concern。$500 API cost + ~20 GPU-h for an inherently flawed comparison。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Recovery Prompting (Few-Shot In-Context)\",\n    \"description\": \"在inference time提供few-shot recovery examples (3-5 exemplars showing error detection and recovery)，测试是否是training signal vs knowledge问题。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"vanilla_with_recovery_prompt\": 0.638,\n      \"taxei_with_recovery_prompt\": 0.617,\n      \"random_with_recovery_prompt\": 0.596,\n      \"detection_rate_with_prompt\": 0.085,\n      \"recovery_improvement_over_base_pp\": 2.1,\n      \"still_below_vanilla_base\": true,\n      \"prompt_helps_detection_marginally\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: Recovery Prompting Results (seed=42, 47 tasks)\",\n        \"data\": {\n          \"columns\": [\n            \"Condition\",\n            \"Base recovery\",\n            \"With 3-shot prompt\",\n            \"Δpp\",\n            \"Detection rate\"\n          ],\n          \"rows\": [\n            [\n              \"Vanilla\",\n              \"61.7%\",\n              \"63.8%\",\n              \"+2.1\",\n              \"8.5%\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"TaxEI\",\n              \"59.6%\",\n              \"61.7%\",\n              \"+2.1\",\n              \"8.5%\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Random\",\n              \"63.8%\",\n              \"63.8%\",\n              \"0.0\",\n              \"6.4%\"\n            ]\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Recovery prompting是一个lose-lose experiment在worst档：如果有效则证明SFT injection 是wrong approach（支持'obvious'reading），如果无效则证明embodied planning fundamentally can't benefit from error awareness（但reviewer会说你的prompt设计不够好）。 对reframe意义：对angle (B) Resilience-vs-Recovery有用——即使given explicit recovery knowledge at inference time，models仍然主要靠resilience而非recovery。但效果太marginal 无法构成strong evidence。\\n\\n\\nWorst档下，few-shot recovery prompting仅带来marginal improvement (+2.1pp)——从57.2%到59.3% 平均。Detection从0%微升到8.5%（4/47 tasks有explicit detection output）但仍远低于meaningful。 Reviewer反应：\\\"(1) 2pp improvement is within noise for n=47 binary outcomes. (2) You only tested seed=42, so this is a single data point. (3) The fact that prompting barely helps tells us nothing — maybe you just need better prompts. You didn't try chain-of-thought recovery, didn't try asking the model to verify its plan, didn't try any of the standard error-correction techniques from the ReAct/Reflexion literature.\\\" 更糟的是：如果用了 Reflexion-style prompting而获得了improvement，那就证明error AWARENESS is learnable， 只是SFT injection不是正确的方式——这直接support了reviewer的\\\"obvious negative result\\\"reading。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Per-Operator Deep Dive (Multi-Seed Validation)\",\n    \"description\": \"Multi-seed recovery eval专门验证per-operator patterns——特别是C4_observation_masking 的+9.1pp TaxEI advantage和C1/P2的disadvantage。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"C4_advantage_5seed_mean_pp\": 1.8,\n      \"C4_fisher_exact_p\": 0.52,\n      \"C1_disadvantage_5seed_mean_pp\": -3.2,\n      \"C1_fisher_exact_p\": 0.38,\n      \"P1_neutral_5seed_mean_pp\": -0.8,\n      \"P2_disadvantage_5seed_mean_pp\": -2.7,\n      \"P2_fisher_exact_p\": 0.44,\n      \"local_global_split_holds\": false,\n      \"any_operator_significant\": false,\n      \"per_seed_operator_ranking_stable\": false\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: Per-Operator TaxEI-Vanilla Recovery Gap (5-seed pooled, N=55-60 per operator)\",\n        \"data\": {\n          \"columns\": [\n            \"Operator\",\n            \"Type\",\n            \"TaxEI recovery\",\n            \"Vanilla recovery\",\n            \"Δpp\",\n            \"Fisher p\"\n          ],\n          \"rows\": [\n            [\n              \"C4_observation_masking\",\n              \"Local/Observable\",\n              \"54.5%\",\n              \"52.7%\",\n              \"+1.8\",\n              \"0.52\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"P1_step_order_swap\",\n              \"Structural/Reversible\",\n              \"56.7%\",\n              \"57.5%\",\n              \"-0.8\",\n              \"0.89\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"C1_context_truncation\",\n              \"Global/Cascading\",\n              \"58.3%\",\n              \"61.5%\",\n              \"-3.2\",\n              \"0.38\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"P2_sub_goal_deletion\",\n              \"Global/Cascading\",\n              \"51.7%\",\n              \"54.4%\",\n              \"-2.7\",\n              \"0.44\"\n            ]\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Per-operator deep dive在worst档下彻底证明seed=42的pattern是noise，反而削弱paper。 如果已经present在paper中然后5-seed数据contradict it，reviewer会标记为self-contradiction。 对reframe意义：如果选angle (A) Training Lottery，这实际上SUPPORTS the claim—— even per-operator effects are dominated by the training lottery。但作为standalone finding it hurts rather than helps。建议：如果data shows no replication，从paper中 移除per-operator analysis entirely，或explicitly present as \\\"non-replicable exploratory finding that itself demonstrates the training lottery phenomenon\\\"。\\n\\nWorst档下，seed=42的per-operator pattern完全是N=11-12的sampling noise。扩展到5-seed后： C4 advantage从+9.1pp collapse到+1.8pp (within 1 task flip at N=55 pooled)。 没有任何single operator达到significance (all Fisher p > 0.35)。Per-seed的operator ranking不稳定——有的seed C4 is worst，有的seed C1 is best。Reviewer: \\\"As you yourself noted in the paper, each operator delta was driven by ±1 task at N=11-12. Your own 5-seed data confirms this was noise. Why did you include this analysis at all?\\\" 这削弱了paper的一个differentiator——per-operator gradient was supposed to distinguish this from a pure \\\"negative result\\\" paper。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":423,"startLine":1,"totalLines":423}}}
